T*
T*
T*
(49. What patient-cell model is proposed for early ROGDI testing?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Patient-derived iPSC neurons, with ameloblast-lineage or dental organoid) Tj
T*
(assays where possible.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Potency assays) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(50. What is milestone 1 in the ROGDI preclinical strategy?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Source-lock and construct design: reconfirm Q9GZN7, lock transcript/cDNA) Tj
T*
(convention, sequence-verify cDNA, and avoid stale annotations.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Preclinical plan) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(51. What is milestone 2 in the ROGDI preclinical strategy?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Patient-cell models: generate disease-relevant cells, confirm reduced or) Tj
T*
(absent ROGDI, and define disease phenotypes.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Preclinical plan) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(52. What is milestone 3 in the ROGDI preclinical strategy?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Vector expression and potency: produce AAV9-hSYN1-ROGDI, confirm) Tj
T*
(expression/localization, measure mechanism-linked rescue, and compare doses.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Preclinical plan) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(53. What is milestone 4 in the ROGDI preclinical strategy?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Animal proof of concept: use a validated Rogdi-deficient model if available) Tj
T*
(and assess biodistribution, expression, seizure burden, survival, behavior, and) Tj
T*
(safety.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Preclinical plan) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(54. What is milestone 5 in the ROGDI preclinical strategy?) Tj
T*
(Answer: IND-enabling package: release assays, potency assays, GLP toxicology,) Tj
T*
(biodistribution, and early regulator engagement.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Preclinical plan) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(55. What is the risk called when AAV does not reach enough affected cells?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Cell-autonomous delivery failure.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Risks) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(56. How should cell-autonomous delivery failure be mitigated?) Tj
T*
(Answer: Quantify direct neuronal transduction and do not assume cross-correction.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Risks) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(57. What is the dental/CNS mismatch risk?) Tj
T*
(Answer: A brain-focused therapy may not fix tooth enamel disease, and a dental-focused) Tj
T*
(therapy will not rescue the brain.) Tj
T*
(Topic: Risks) Tj
T*
T*
T*
